  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Program to Strengthen Education Sector Management</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Fortalecimiento de la Gestin del Sector Educativo</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo del programa es mejorar la calidad del sistema de educacin pblicaen Chile a travs del fortalecimiento yo creacin de capacidades de liderazgo y soporte tcnico-pedaggico a nivel central y local de dicho sistema.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The program objective is to improve the quality of the public education system in Chile by strengthening andor creating leadership and technicalpedagogical support capabilities at the central and local levels of the system</narrative>
  </description>
